-2. **Setting Resident Data (`SetResidentVoxelData`)**: Replace `VoxelArray` with input data (moved). Set `Residency` to `Resident`. Reset `bDataMutated`, `bUniformValueValid`, `bCompressionEvaluated`. Clear `CompressedVoxelData`. Reset `AsyncCompactTicket`. Increment `ContentVersion` [S1, unofficial].
-3. **Clearing Data (`ClearVoxelData`)**: Reset `VoxelArray`. Set `Residency` to `Empty`. Reset `bDataMutated`, `bUniformValueValid`, `bCompressionEvaluated`. Clear `CompressedVoxelData`. Reset `AsyncCompactTicket`. Do NOT increment `ContentVersion` (clearing is memory teardown, not a logical change) [S1, unofficial].
