-5. **Writing a Voxel (`SetVoxel`)**: Calculate `Index`. If index is valid in resident array: Detach `VoxelArray` (using `IsUnique()` check to avoid unnecessary copies). Set `DetachVoxelArray()[Index] = Data`. Set `bIsDirty = true`, `bDataMutated = true`. Reset `bUniformValueValid`, `bCompressionEvaluated`. Clear `CompressedVoxelData`. Reset `AsyncCompactTicket`. Increment `ContentVersion` [S1, unofficial].
-6. **Checking Uniformity (`TryCollapseUniform`)**: If `Residency` is not `Resident`, return `false`. If `bUniformValueValid` is `true`: Reset `VoxelArray`. Set `Residency` to `Uniform`. Reset `AsyncCompactTicket`. Return `true`. Else: Set `bCompressionEvaluated = true`. Call `ComputeUniformValue(GetResidentArray(), Value)`. If true: Set `UniformValue = Value`, `bUniformValueValid = true`. Reset `VoxelArray`. Set `Residency` to `Uniform`. Reset `AsyncCompactTicket`. Return `true`. Else return `false` [S1, unofficial].
-7. **Compressing (`TryCompress`)**: If `Residency` is not `Resident`, return `false`. If `bUniformValueValid` is `true` or `CompressedVoxelData.Num() > 0`: Call `DropResidentForCachedForm()`. Else: Call `InstallCompactForm(ComputeCompactForm(GetResidentArray(), Codec, ChunkSize))` [S1, unofficial].
