-9. **Installing Compact Form (`InstallCompactForm`)**: Input: `Form`, `bDropResident`. If `Residency` is not `Resident`, return `false`. Set `AsyncCompactTicket` to 0 and `bCompressionEvaluated` to `true`. If `Kind` is `Uniform`: Set `UniformValue` and `bUniformValueValid` to `true`. If `Kind` is `Compressed`: Move `Form.Buffer` to `CompressedVoxelData`. Set `bDataMutated` to `false`. If `bDropResident` is `true`, call `DropResidentForCachedForm` [S1, unofficial].
-10. **Dropping Resident (`DropResidentForCachedForm`)**: If `Residency` is not `Resident`, return `false`. If `bUniformValueValid` is `true`: Reset `VoxelArray`. Set `Residency` to `Uniform`. Else if `CompressedVoxelData.Num() > 0`: Reset `VoxelArray`. Set `Residency` to `Compressed`. Else return `false`. Set `AsyncCompactTicket` to 0. Return `true` if residency was changed [S1, unofficial].
-11. **Computing Uniform Value (`ComputeUniformValue`)**: Input: `Data`, `Out`. If empty, return `false`. Cast data to `uint32` words. If `sizeof(FVoxelData) == sizeof(uint32)`: Loop in blocks of 64 words. OR-reduce XOR differences against the first word. If any difference found, return `false`. Check remaining elements individually. If all identical, write first element to `Out` and return `true` [S1, unofficial].
-12. **Expanding (`Expand`)**: If `Residency` is `Uniform`: Initialize `Out` with `UniformValue` repeated `TotalVoxels` times. Return `true`. If `Residency` is `Compressed`: Call `FVoxelChunkCodec::Decompress(Buffer, Out)`. Return `Out.Num() == TotalVoxels`. Else return `false` [S1, unofficial].
